The '''Westbound Wetlands''' are a sub-location of the [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Features ==
The '''Westbound Wetlands''' are a large field where players can harvest {{Item|Mangrove Log}}s. The {{Zone|Tranquil Pass}} can be accessed from a pathway behind a waterfall.

